WEBVTT

00:04.450 --> 00:06.900
<i>As the second half begins, Tsubasa dribbles ahead!</i>

00:08.730 --> 00:09.820
Tsubasa!

00:13.440 --> 00:15.570
<i>Tsubasa, when you see the goal, shoot!</i>

00:16.200 --> 00:17.330
<i>Okay, Roberto.</i>

00:17.330 --> 00:20.870
<i>Wakabayashi, Misaki, watch me!</i>

00:20.870 --> 00:23.250
<i>This is my Drive Shot!</i>

00:24.170 --> 00:26.080
It takes off!

00:30.260 --> 00:32.970
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:30.260 --> 00:32.970
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:33.880 --> 00:36.550
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:33.880 --> 00:36.550
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:37.470 --> 00:40.180
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:37.470 --> 00:40.180
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:47.060 --> 00:49.900
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

00:47.060 --> 00:49.900
<i>I keep running, lying to myself</i>

00:49.900 --> 00:56.160
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete</i>

00:49.900 --> 00:56.160
<i>that I can live alone, though the loneliness makes me burn</i>

00:56.160 --> 01:02.040
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni</i>

00:56.160 --> 01:02.040
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

01:02.040 --> 01:08.630
<i>kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni</i>

01:02.040 --> 01:08.630
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

01:08.630 --> 01:12.630
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

01:08.630 --> 01:12.630
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

01:12.630 --> 01:17.140
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

01:12.630 --> 01:17.140
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

01:17.140 --> 01:22.720
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

01:17.140 --> 01:22.720
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

01:22.720 --> 01:24.270
<i>baka darou?</i>

01:22.720 --> 01:24.270
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

01:24.270 --> 01:25.480
<i>ai</i>

01:24.270 --> 01:25.480
<i>Love!</i>

01:25.480 --> 01:28.980
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

01:25.480 --> 01:28.980
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

01:28.980 --> 01:38.870
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

01:28.980 --> 01:38.870
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

01:38.870 --> 01:39.700
<i>ai</i>

01:38.870 --> 01:39.700
<i>Love!</i>

01:39.700 --> 01:43.490
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

01:39.700 --> 01:43.490
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

01:43.490 --> 01:47.500
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

01:43.490 --> 01:47.500
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

01:47.500 --> 01:53.760
<i>kono ai mo ichido taritomo</i>

01:47.500 --> 01:53.760
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

01:53.760 --> 01:56.550
<i>hanasanai</i>

01:53.760 --> 01:56.550
<i>for a single moment!</i>

01:58.260 --> 02:03.140
<b><b>EPISODE 42:
TSUBASA THE PHOENIX</b></b>

01:58.790 --> 02:04.680
<i>As soon as he enters Hirado's side, he's preparing to shoot!</i>

02:10.260 --> 02:11.560
Have you lost it, Tsubasa?!

02:11.560 --> 02:12.540
Are you panicking?!

02:12.540 --> 02:14.500
Shooting from there would be meaningless.

02:14.500 --> 02:15.810
Th-this is...

02:15.810 --> 02:17.320
So, you'll use it now, Tsubasa...

02:17.780 --> 02:19.200
...your still imperfect...

02:19.960 --> 02:21.240
Drive Shot!

02:21.720 --> 02:24.540
<i>He's taking a long shot with everything he's got!</i>

02:26.420 --> 02:29.040
Hatayama, there's no need to get so worked up, y'know.

02:29.730 --> 02:32.880
It doesn't matter how strong a shot is if it can't find its target.

02:43.180 --> 02:43.850
What?!

02:45.290 --> 02:47.350
<i>It... it's in!</i>

02:50.800 --> 02:51.600
It's finally in!

02:51.600 --> 02:52.480
You did it!

02:52.480 --> 02:53.980
You finally did it!

02:53.980 --> 02:56.240
Well done, Tsubasa!

02:56.860 --> 02:58.010
Hooray!

02:58.010 --> 02:59.010
Yes!

02:59.010 --> 03:01.950
You've finally scored with your Drive Shot, Tsubasa!

03:02.590 --> 03:04.200
Drive Shot...?

03:04.200 --> 03:09.260
<i>It looked like Tsubasa's shot would sail over the goalpost,</i>

03:09.260 --> 03:13.910
<i>but thanks to the sharp spin on the ball, it sank right in!</i>

03:11.420 --> 03:12.880
So you finally did it...

03:12.880 --> 03:13.680
Yes.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.520
The Drive Shot is amazing!

03:13.910 --> 03:16.420
<i>It pierced into the net!</i>

03:15.520 --> 03:16.420
Tsubasa!

03:16.420 --> 03:18.720
He did it! He did it!

03:16.420 --> 03:21.750
<i>He has finally perfected the Drive Shot he's tried countless times in this tournament.</i>

03:18.720 --> 03:19.670
Tsubasa...

03:21.750 --> 03:23.340
Damn it! That was just a fluke, y'know!

03:23.770 --> 03:26.850
A shot like that can only be a fluke, y'know...

03:26.850 --> 03:29.560
<i>It's barely been a minute since the start of the second half.</i>

03:29.560 --> 03:32.560
<i>Hirado have conceded a goal for the first time in this tournament.</i>

03:32.560 --> 03:35.130
That drive spin was amazing.

03:35.130 --> 03:36.690
Can a ball just fall like that?

03:36.690 --> 03:38.690
I wouldn't just call that falling.

03:38.690 --> 03:39.930
It literally dove!

03:39.930 --> 03:43.320
The ball hastily lunged into the net from high above.

03:43.320 --> 03:44.320
Tsubasa...

03:47.560 --> 03:52.980
<i>It was like a bird, spreading its wings in the sky before diving to catch its prey.</i>

03:52.980 --> 03:55.630
<i>That's what Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot is.</i>

03:56.250 --> 04:05.240
<i>So far, his attempts were hit or miss, but this time, he had to score at all costs.</i>

04:05.780 --> 04:12.440
<i>Despite all the added pressure, Tsubasa Ozora persevered and was able to reveal his true skills.</i>

04:13.620 --> 04:18.570
<i>He was able to overcome the handicap of his shoulder injury, rising from the ashes like a phoenix.</i>

04:18.570 --> 04:21.440
<i>You really are a remarkable man.</i>

04:21.440 --> 04:22.490
Yahoo!

04:22.490 --> 04:24.320
So you finally did it, Tsubasa!

04:24.320 --> 04:26.820
Awesome! You're awesome, Tsubasa!

04:27.340 --> 04:29.080
<i>Nankatsu steals the ball.</i>

04:29.560 --> 04:33.340
<i>After taking a goal from Hirado, Nankatsu proceed to attack Hirado's side.</i>

04:36.560 --> 04:38.920
<i>Hirado's Sano intercepts the ball once again.</i>

04:44.910 --> 04:45.960
Crap!

04:45.960 --> 04:49.180
<i>His distraction with Tsubasa costs him the ball!</i>

04:50.120 --> 04:51.310
Tsubasa!

04:52.160 --> 04:54.220
<i>And it's passed to Tsubasa!</i>

04:54.220 --> 04:56.650
<i>Their combination play was perfectly executed!</i>

05:04.820 --> 05:07.820
<i>Tsubasa turns away and fires an immediate long shot!</i>

05:07.820 --> 05:08.700
What!?

05:12.570 --> 05:14.530
<i>It's in!</i>

05:14.530 --> 05:16.420
<i>The goalkeeper can't even move a muscle.</i>

05:17.140 --> 05:18.930
<i>It's another Drive Shot!</i>

05:18.930 --> 05:20.370
<i>The second goal from Tsubasa!</i>

05:20.370 --> 05:22.420
Nice shot, Tsubasa!

05:25.700 --> 05:27.470
<i>We need two more goal to turn this around.</i>

05:27.920 --> 05:29.640
<i>We're 3 minutes into the second half.</i>

05:29.640 --> 05:34.480
<i>Thanks to Tsubasa's second Drive Shot, the lead has been whittled down to one.</i>

05:34.480 --> 05:37.730
<i>Tsubasa Ozora is the superstar of middle school football!</i>

05:37.730 --> 05:41.460
<i>Despite his injuries, he is showing his tenacity for victory.</i>

05:41.460 --> 05:42.690
<i>Just two more...</i>

05:42.690 --> 05:48.910
<i>Even if I permanently mess up my shoulder or leg here, I'll definitely score these last two goals!</i>

05:49.460 --> 05:51.190
<i>That's the Tsubasa I know.</i>

05:51.190 --> 05:53.840
<i>Mastering such an amazing shot...</i>

05:53.840 --> 05:56.080
<i>It's the very definition of a perfect long shot.</i>

05:56.080 --> 06:02.090
<i>While I was sidelined these last two years, Tsubasa managed to improve this much...</i>

06:02.560 --> 06:04.500
<i>I'm happy, Tsubasa.</i>

06:04.500 --> 06:07.590
<i>I didn't know you'd mastered such a shot.</i>

06:07.590 --> 06:13.350
<i>But I, too, have my own super shot, sleeping in my this right leg of mine...</i>

06:14.030 --> 06:21.710
Oh boy... I really want to see Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot go against Kojiro Hyuga's Tiger Shot.

06:22.110 --> 06:26.550
During Toho's first match, I saw that shot of yours while I was near the bench.

06:26.550 --> 06:29.800
So, I dubbed it the "Tiger Shot".

06:29.800 --> 06:31.120
Tiger Shot...

06:31.120 --> 06:33.290
It's got a nice ring to it, doesn't it?

06:33.290 --> 06:35.370
Ah, I should introduce myself.

06:35.370 --> 06:37.870
I'm Tajima, from Toto Sports.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.820
Nice to meet you.

06:42.380 --> 06:44.800
TSUBASA OZORA
DRIVE SHOT IS COMPLETE!

06:43.300 --> 06:44.800
Our headline is ready.

06:44.800 --> 06:49.050
Well, it'll go to waste if Nankatsu loses, though...

06:49.050 --> 06:51.050
Make sure you win, Tsubasa!

06:53.750 --> 06:55.840
<i>Hirado's lead over Nankatsu is down to one!</i>

06:55.840 --> 06:59.480
<i>Surprisingly, their defender Jito stands at the center circle.</i>

06:59.480 --> 07:00.440
I'm coming, y'know!

07:02.930 --> 07:04.300
<i>The game resumes.</i>

07:04.300 --> 07:07.780
<i>Sano leaves the ball to Jito, and dashes to Nankatsu's goal.</i>

07:07.780 --> 07:10.450
I'll take him!

07:10.450 --> 07:11.300
What?!

07:11.300 --> 07:13.280
<i>Jito doesn't even budge!</i>

07:13.910 --> 07:15.280
The hell's with that strength...?!

07:15.280 --> 07:17.330
<i>Sano swiftly advances to the goal.</i>

07:19.540 --> 07:21.370
<i>Sano shakes off his markers.</i>

07:23.310 --> 07:24.740
<i>Here we go, Sano.</i>

07:24.740 --> 07:27.100
<i>Our combination play is invincible, y'know!</i>

07:27.100 --> 07:29.080
<i>We'll get back every goal we conceded, y'know!</i>

07:29.080 --> 07:31.090
<i>Jito's special bullet pass.</i>

07:31.090 --> 07:32.640
You won't have it your way!

07:33.530 --> 07:35.890
<i>Izawa blocks it with his whole body!</i>

07:35.890 --> 07:36.640
What?!

07:36.640 --> 07:37.680
Izawa!

07:41.230 --> 07:43.450
Don't let Izawa's sacrifice go to waste!

07:43.450 --> 07:44.980
We'll mark the hell out of this guy!

07:44.980 --> 07:47.900
Damn it! Then I'll just have to do it myself, y'know!

07:50.820 --> 07:54.820
Morisaki, stand your ground!
This one's also got backspin on it!

07:54.820 --> 07:55.570
What!?

07:55.570 --> 07:56.950
Got it, Tsubasa!

07:56.950 --> 07:59.960
Don't give them any openings! We'll keep marking Sano!

07:59.960 --> 08:00.330
Yeah!

08:03.000 --> 08:05.580
<i>The ball rebounds backwards!</i>

08:05.580 --> 08:09.090
My combination play with the Captain is invincible...!

08:12.420 --> 08:13.500
<i>He got it!</i>

08:13.500 --> 08:15.500
<i>Morisaki firmly catches it.</i>

08:16.260 --> 08:17.510
Nice one, Morisaki!

08:17.510 --> 08:19.850
Our combination play...

08:19.850 --> 08:21.020
Did you see that?

08:21.020 --> 08:23.600
You can't fool us twice with the same old trick!

08:23.600 --> 08:26.110
<i>Nankatsu's defense has become stronger too.</i>

08:26.110 --> 08:27.110
Here!

08:27.110 --> 08:28.320
Damn it all!

08:28.750 --> 08:32.470
<i>The ball is quickly sent forward to #10, Tsubasa.</i>

08:38.410 --> 08:42.250
<i>Will Tsubasa proceed to fire another Drive Shot right away?!</i>

08:42.250 --> 08:43.790
I won't let you!

08:44.470 --> 08:47.460
<i>Jito goes to block the Drive Shot.</i>

08:48.670 --> 08:51.170
<i>Go!</i>

08:53.230 --> 08:55.300
<i>I saw a splash!</i>

08:55.300 --> 08:57.510
<i>The ball goes out the sideline.</i>

08:57.510 --> 08:58.510
Jito!

08:59.540 --> 09:03.020
<i>Looks like Jito took Tsubasa's shot directly into his face.</i>

09:04.150 --> 09:06.980
<i>The game is stopped for him to receive treatment.</i>

09:08.130 --> 09:09.700
Are you okay, Jito?

09:09.700 --> 09:10.480
Captain!

09:11.580 --> 09:16.980
I thought this game was over in the first half, but that's Nankatsu for you, y'know...

09:16.980 --> 09:22.380
Cutting my brow open with a single shot—me, who can take all kinds of punches in a brawl...

09:22.380 --> 09:25.960
Your Drive Shot is awfully strong.

09:25.960 --> 09:29.960
Bravo... Bravo, y'know, Tsubasa Ozora!

09:30.840 --> 09:34.800
But this is what I've been hoping for all this time.

09:34.800 --> 09:39.470
The greater my opponent is,
the more value there is in crushing them.

09:42.130 --> 09:44.480
You heard our Captain.

09:44.480 --> 09:47.400
The real match starts now.

09:53.510 --> 09:56.610
<i>The game resumes with Nankatsu's throw-in.</i>

09:57.610 --> 09:58.450
Here I go!

09:59.080 --> 09:59.840
Be careful!

09:59.840 --> 10:01.950
He's gonna send it to in front of the goal!

10:02.400 --> 10:04.700
We'll score this one with our headers!

10:04.700 --> 10:05.960
Yeah!

10:05.960 --> 10:08.090
<i>Their numbers don't matter; there's only one ball!</i>

10:08.090 --> 10:09.830
<i>I won't lose a battle of height, y'know!</i>

10:12.090 --> 10:12.750
What?!

10:12.750 --> 10:13.960
All right!

10:13.960 --> 10:15.960
Here I go, Tsubasa!

10:15.960 --> 10:17.960
<i>The ball is sent to Tsubasa!</i>

10:17.960 --> 10:21.930
<i>The four Nankatsu players in front of the goal were all decoys!</i>

10:22.930 --> 10:24.140
Tsubasa!

10:26.770 --> 10:31.270
As long as we don't stop that Drive Shot, we have no guarantee of winning this game!

10:31.270 --> 10:33.520
<i>Sano is marking Tsubasa!</i>

10:33.520 --> 10:37.530
<i>But Tsubasa's focus is on the ball—and the goal!</i>

10:37.530 --> 10:39.360
<i>Go!</i>

10:39.360 --> 10:41.120
Drive Shot!

10:43.270 --> 10:45.830
<i>Sano flies into the air!</i>

10:47.880 --> 10:48.830
Sano!

10:48.830 --> 10:50.750
<i>The ball is still in the game.</i>

10:50.750 --> 10:53.080
<i>Tsubasa runs to the loose ball.</i>

10:54.340 --> 10:57.920
<i>Since the start of the half, we've felt
his intense obsession with scoring.</i>

10:57.920 --> 10:59.260
God damn it!

11:00.170 --> 11:03.180
<i>Tsubasa is getting ready for his fifth Drive Shot today!</i>

11:05.390 --> 11:08.020
Tsubasa! If you use Drive Shot any more...

11:17.030 --> 11:20.240
<i>Tsubasa is getting ready for his fifth Drive Shot today!</i>

11:22.170 --> 11:24.910
<i>Jito rushes to the block him!</i>

11:29.370 --> 11:33.460
<i>Whoa! Jito takes the Drive Shot head on with his body!</i>

11:34.290 --> 11:37.050
<i>But even Jito's giant body is sent flying!</i>

11:39.210 --> 11:41.650
<i>Hirado tenaciously protects their goal!</i>

11:41.650 --> 11:43.720
<i>They won't let their opponent tie so easily.</i>

11:43.720 --> 11:47.220
<i>Tsubasa runs toward the loose ball once again.</i>

11:47.220 --> 11:48.640
<i>Not yet!</i>

11:48.640 --> 11:50.980
<i>My Drive Shot is not defeated yet!</i>

11:50.980 --> 11:55.150
<i>The Drive Shot Roberto taught me is invincible!</i>

11:57.510 --> 12:02.070
<i>It's a sixth—and third in a row—Drive Shot!</i>

12:02.070 --> 12:05.530
Like hell, would I let you catch up with us!

12:06.040 --> 12:09.370
<i>Jito goes to fend this off again!</i>

12:13.420 --> 12:16.670
<i>He really shows his fighting spirit on defense!</i>

12:19.200 --> 12:21.310
<i>He stopped!</i>

12:23.450 --> 12:26.430
<i>But... This is...</i>

12:29.650 --> 12:33.640
<i>G... Goal! It's 3-3, the game is tied!</i>

12:33.640 --> 12:38.360
<i>Even though Jito successfully stopped the Drive Shot, he was pushed past the goal line.</i>

12:39.770 --> 12:41.920
Good job, Tsubasa!

12:41.920 --> 12:43.780
You did it, Tsubasa!

12:44.540 --> 12:45.780
I failed, y'know.

12:46.560 --> 12:52.620
<i>Tsubasa pressed forward with his three shots and finally managed to send Jito, the giant, flying.</i>

12:52.620 --> 12:55.200
<i>It's the tying goal, bringing them to 3-3.</i>

12:55.200 --> 12:58.080
<i>He's accomplished a hat-trick with his Drive Shot!</i>

12:59.000 --> 13:01.410
It's tied, we've caught up.

13:01.410 --> 13:02.640
Just one more left.

13:02.640 --> 13:04.070
Just one more goal.

13:06.550 --> 13:07.330
Tsubasa!

13:07.330 --> 13:07.970
Wha–

13:07.700 --> 13:10.850
<i>Did he run himself dry after taking a sixth Drive Shot?</i>

13:08.720 --> 13:09.600
Tsubasa!

13:10.850 --> 13:13.620
<i>Tsubasa is on the ground once again.</i>

13:13.620 --> 13:15.140
One more goal.

13:15.140 --> 13:16.600
I have to score just one more.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.830
Damn it.

13:17.830 --> 13:19.210
The game is even.

13:19.210 --> 13:21.110
It's not like we've lost, y'know!

13:21.110 --> 13:22.160
Tsubasa...

13:22.160 --> 13:23.260
Tsubasa!

13:25.590 --> 13:27.320
So the game is tied, huh...?

13:27.320 --> 13:28.490
Tsubasa!

13:28.490 --> 13:30.940
Sorry guys.

13:30.940 --> 13:33.330
I'm a really pitiful sight for a captain, aren't I...?

13:33.930 --> 13:37.720
I keep pathetically falling onto the ground, over and over...

13:37.720 --> 13:39.370
The hell are you on about, Tsubasa?!

13:39.370 --> 13:40.830
Why would you say you're pitiful?!

13:40.830 --> 13:42.590
Even after scoring three goals yourself...

13:42.590 --> 13:45.290
Look, Tsubasa, come on and take a breather.

13:45.290 --> 13:48.010
We'll definitely stop them from scoring again.

13:48.010 --> 13:51.050
We still have time to make a comeback.

13:51.050 --> 13:53.010
We will work ourselves dry while you recover.

13:53.710 --> 13:55.010
Sure.

13:55.010 --> 13:56.520
Thanks, guys.

13:58.180 --> 13:59.770
Bring it on, Nankatsu!

14:00.630 --> 14:02.270
The showdown starts now.

14:05.230 --> 14:06.280
Sano...

14:06.790 --> 14:10.160
Damn, though... Two Drive Shots taken, huh?

14:10.160 --> 14:13.330
This hurts more way more than any kick I've ever taken in a brawl.

14:13.940 --> 14:18.000
<i>Now that Hirado's given up their lead, how will they stir themselves back into this game?</i>

14:18.520 --> 14:21.430
<i>The match resumes with Hirado's kick off.</i>

14:21.430 --> 14:23.750
<i>We're merely back where we started.</i>

14:25.300 --> 14:26.920
<i>Here I come, Nankatsu!</i>

14:26.920 --> 14:30.970
<i>As Hirado's forward, I will score the game-winning goal!</i>

14:30.970 --> 14:32.530
Go for it, Hirado!

14:32.530 --> 14:33.470
It's just a tie!

14:34.400 --> 14:37.420
<i>Kisugi and Taki are easily dribbled past!</i>

14:37.420 --> 14:40.600
<i>It seems their movements are still sluggish in the second half.</i>

14:42.110 --> 14:47.070
<i>Even Tsubasa looks absolutely exhausted after taking a sixth Drive Shot.</i>

14:47.660 --> 14:49.520
I won't let you go any further!

14:49.520 --> 14:52.240
<i>In these circumstances, is he the one they will depend on?</i>

14:56.380 --> 14:59.540
<i>Which one of them will win this face-off?</i>

15:01.530 --> 15:02.370
Wha–

15:02.370 --> 15:04.540
<i>Ishizaki steals the ball!</i>

15:06.540 --> 15:08.720
I still have plenty left in the tank!

15:08.720 --> 15:10.190
It won't go as you planned!

15:10.190 --> 15:13.020
We don't plan on relying on Jito and Sano forever!

15:13.020 --> 15:15.470
We are also members of Hirado!

15:15.470 --> 15:16.390
Whoa!

15:17.480 --> 15:18.520
Huh?!

15:18.520 --> 15:20.390
<i>Ishizaki loses the ball.</i>

15:20.390 --> 15:21.900
Guys...

15:21.900 --> 15:24.250
This is thanks to you, Jito.

15:24.250 --> 15:24.900
Huh?

15:24.900 --> 15:30.070
It was because you started playing football seriously that the others were able to make it this far.

15:30.610 --> 15:34.320
So far, that they can challenge the reigning champions, Nankatsu.

15:34.320 --> 15:38.080
You know, it takes at least 11 people to have a football team.

15:38.950 --> 15:41.500
Yeah... you're damn right, y'know.

15:41.500 --> 15:43.370
<i>Time is running out this second half.</i>

15:43.370 --> 15:46.000
<i>The next goal is sure to decide the winner of this match.</i>

15:46.000 --> 15:47.500
Send it here, y'know!

15:48.080 --> 15:50.220
<i>Jito is quickly advancing to the front line!</i>

15:50.220 --> 15:51.760
<i>There are five minutes left!</i>

15:52.170 --> 15:53.430
<i>The ball is sent to Jito.</i>

15:56.750 --> 15:58.470
<i>But the pass is much too high!</i>

15:58.470 --> 15:59.970
Here I go!

16:02.310 --> 16:05.810
<i>Sano goes up for a direct Overhead Kick!</i>

16:05.810 --> 16:07.550
<i>It's Tsubasa!</i>

16:07.550 --> 16:09.230
<i>Tsubasa jumps with all he's got!</i>

16:09.230 --> 16:10.690
Thank you, Tsubasa!

16:11.390 --> 16:13.290
<i>Morisaki makes a diving catch!</i>

16:13.290 --> 16:14.320
<i>They stopped it!</i>

16:14.320 --> 16:15.320
<i>Nankatsu stopped them!</i>

16:17.620 --> 16:18.540
Come, Morisaki!

16:18.540 --> 16:19.160
Throw it!

16:19.980 --> 16:20.870
Tsubasa!

16:23.440 --> 16:25.170
<i>The ball reaches Tsubasa now.</i>

16:25.170 --> 16:26.750
Damn it all!

16:26.750 --> 16:28.270
Turn back!

16:28.270 --> 16:29.760
<i>Four minutes left!</i>

16:29.760 --> 16:31.420
<i>It's a counter-attack for Nankatsu!</i>

16:31.810 --> 16:33.310
Go, Tsubasa!

16:33.310 --> 16:35.930
In the end, it all comes down to you!

16:36.450 --> 16:37.550
<i>One more!</i>

16:37.550 --> 16:39.690
<i>One more shot will decide the score.</i>

16:39.690 --> 16:42.680
<i>I will run until I can see the goal!</i>

16:42.680 --> 16:46.920
<i>Tsubasa's dribbling speed is about as fast as his full sprint.</i>

16:46.920 --> 16:52.130
<i>It really feels like he was born to play football, after all!</i>

16:52.130 --> 16:54.250
Go for it, Tsubasa!

16:54.250 --> 16:56.400
<i>Tsubasa is so, so fast!</i>

16:56.400 --> 16:59.450
<i>No one in Hirado is able to catch up!</i>

16:59.880 --> 17:01.700
<i>I see it now.</i>

17:01.700 --> 17:02.930
<i>It's the goal!</i>

17:04.490 --> 17:10.880
<i>So you'll go for another Drive Shot, even with all of your injuries, Tsubasa Ozora?</i>

17:10.880 --> 17:14.470
<i>If that's the case, then I will take as many of them as I can head on,</i>

17:14.470 --> 17:16.720
<i>until you finally run yourself dry, y'know!</i>

17:17.140 --> 17:20.140
<i>Guys, you've let me rest more than enough.</i>

17:20.140 --> 17:23.930
<i>So this time, I will score the winner!</i>

17:24.630 --> 17:26.350
<i>I will stop you before you can shoot!</i>

17:31.110 --> 17:33.280
<i>What a quick swing!</i>

17:34.780 --> 17:36.200
Bring it, Tsubasa!

17:40.420 --> 17:41.710
<i>What happened to Tsubasa?</i>

17:41.710 --> 17:43.270
<i>He's staggering!</i>

17:43.270 --> 17:43.960
Tsubasa!

17:43.960 --> 17:45.210
What?!

17:45.210 --> 17:47.480
<i>It's no good.</i>

17:47.480 --> 17:49.710
<i>I'm out of strength...</i>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.460
So you've run out of gas, huh, Tsubasa?!

17:54.820 --> 17:55.810
<i>Tsubasa!</i>

17:55.810 --> 17:56.800
<i>Tsubasa.</i>

17:56.800 --> 17:58.690
<i>Trust them.</i>

17:58.690 --> 17:59.930
<i>That's right, Tsubasa.</i>

17:59.930 --> 18:02.350
<i>Isn't football played with 11 people?</i>

18:02.350 --> 18:04.640
<i>Misaki, Wakabayashi...</i>

18:05.210 --> 18:06.910
<i>Exactly as they say, Tsubasa.</i>

18:06.910 --> 18:09.440
<i>You can't play football by yourself.</i>

18:09.440 --> 18:10.590
<i>Roberto!</i>

18:14.760 --> 18:15.400
Tsubasa!

18:16.300 --> 18:18.150
<i>I'm counting on you... Kisugi, Taki.</i>

18:18.150 --> 18:20.730
Let's go! This is our last chance!

18:20.730 --> 18:23.700
We'll drill this ball we got from Tsubasa into the goal for sure!

18:23.700 --> 18:25.630
If it's just them two, that's good news!

18:25.630 --> 18:27.410
We can intercept their passes easily.

18:27.410 --> 18:29.750
We won't let you make a fool out of us anymore!

18:29.750 --> 18:30.980
Let's go, Kisugi!

18:30.980 --> 18:31.540
Sure!

18:31.540 --> 18:34.460
<i>They easily put together a string of great one-two passes.</i>

18:34.460 --> 18:36.880
<i>They are perfectly in sync!</i>

18:36.880 --> 18:38.390
Well, of course!

18:38.390 --> 18:41.470
We've formed a duo since elementary school!

18:41.470 --> 18:44.920
We may not be able to match Misaki and Tsubasa's Golden Duo,

18:44.920 --> 18:47.480
but we certainly shine in our way!

18:48.160 --> 18:50.430
I will send you flying once again!

18:50.430 --> 18:51.980
As if I'd let that happen again!

18:53.080 --> 18:54.020
What?!

18:55.780 --> 19:01.660
The former scorer of Shutetsu, Teppei Kisugi, is the scorer of Nankatsu now!

19:03.620 --> 19:05.810
<i>It's in! Goal!</i>

19:05.810 --> 19:07.260
Hell yeah, Kisugi!

19:07.260 --> 19:08.580
He did it!

19:10.210 --> 19:11.330
It's decided.

19:11.330 --> 19:12.580
Nankatsu has...

19:12.580 --> 19:14.190
<i>There's just one minute left.</i>

19:14.190 --> 19:16.090
<i>Nankatsu finally make their comeback.</i>

19:16.090 --> 19:20.550
<i>Taki and Kisugi were the ones to score the fourth goal!</i>

19:20.550 --> 19:25.010
<i>That's right, football is played with 11 people.</i>

19:25.010 --> 19:27.010
<i>You've got to trust your friends.</i>

19:27.010 --> 19:29.060
Kisugi, Taki.

19:29.060 --> 19:31.060
Thank you!

19:31.060 --> 19:32.830
It was a piece of cake!

19:32.830 --> 19:35.570
You guys did a great job on defense too!

19:35.570 --> 19:37.590
He had his share in the goal!

19:37.590 --> 19:39.810
Tsubasa is really cool!

19:39.810 --> 19:43.150
Oh you... Let's not forget to cheer for Kisugi and Taki too!

19:43.150 --> 19:46.080
We have to defend for one more minute.

19:56.840 --> 19:59.340
Go!

20:00.520 --> 20:02.180
<i>The match ends here!</i>

20:02.180 --> 20:03.750
<i>It's 4-3!</i>

20:03.750 --> 20:06.130
<i>Nankatsu win the game after a very close call!</i>

20:06.130 --> 20:09.800
<i>Despite the many hardships, they take their seat in the best 4 for a third year in a row!</i>

20:09.800 --> 20:12.610
<i>Two matches from their first three consecutive championships ever.</i>

20:12.610 --> 20:13.560
We won!

20:13.560 --> 20:15.600
Looks like it'll be Nankatsu after all.

20:15.600 --> 20:16.150
Yeah.

20:16.850 --> 20:18.650
So you've won, Tsubasa.

20:18.650 --> 20:20.710
You frickin' did it, Tsubasa!

20:20.710 --> 20:24.160
It would've sucked if you'd lost
just as you perfected your Drive Shot.

20:24.820 --> 20:26.660
You did it, Tsubasa.

20:26.660 --> 20:31.620
<i>Hirado did a real good job cornering the reigning champion Nankatsu this badly for a first-time contender.</i>

20:32.110 --> 20:35.870
<i>However, Tsubasa's Drive Shot, which tied the game single-handedly,</i>

20:35.870 --> 20:37.980
<i>was the real highlight of the game.</i>

20:37.980 --> 20:41.470
<i>The game winner came from a brilliant
combination play between Kisugi and Taki.</i>

20:41.470 --> 20:45.640
<i>They truly came together as a unit and made their way into the semi-finals.</i>

20:46.230 --> 20:49.390
In the end, Nankatsu's teamwork saw them through to victory.

20:50.450 --> 20:53.390
Now we both have one more game to go, Tsubasa.

20:53.390 --> 20:54.520
Damn it.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.140
Damn it...

20:55.140 --> 20:56.660
Damn it!

20:58.370 --> 21:01.530
This loss was a long time coming, y'know...

21:01.530 --> 21:06.530
<i>Losing really hurts. But, I feel strangely refreshed, y'know.</i>

21:08.480 --> 21:09.740
Get on your feet, Sano.

21:09.740 --> 21:10.540
Captain.

21:10.960 --> 21:12.130
Don't cry.

21:12.130 --> 21:14.330
You have one more year to go, y'know.

21:14.330 --> 21:18.700
Make sure you come here next year too and win this time!

21:18.700 --> 21:19.420
Yes!

21:21.210 --> 21:22.920
<i>Tsubasa Ozora...</i>

21:22.920 --> 21:26.340
<i>It was supposed to be a one year journey for me.</i>

21:26.340 --> 21:30.930
<i>But now I don't think I can quit playing football until I've defeated you, y'know.</i>

21:31.510 --> 21:34.000
<i>Before today, you were just a brawler...</i>

21:34.000 --> 21:36.190
I'm really proud of your growth, Hiroshi.

21:41.160 --> 21:45.910
<i>There are those who win and advance,
and also those who lose and are eliminated.</i>

21:45.910 --> 21:50.850
<i>In this tournament, held with 47 teams from all around the nation,</i>

21:50.850 --> 21:55.460
<i>finally, the four best teams have been determined.</i>

21:55.460 --> 22:00.380
<i>The previous champions,
Nankatsu Middle School, representing Shizuoka.</i>

22:01.090 --> 22:04.260
<i>Furano Middle School, representing Hokkaido.</i>

22:04.790 --> 22:08.260
<i>Meiwa Higashi Middle School,
representing the Saitama Prefecture.</i>

22:09.240 --> 22:12.260
<i>Toho Academy, representing Tokyo.</i>

22:13.380 --> 22:20.020
<i>Tomorrow, these four teams will battle, with a seat at the grand finals at stake.</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.200 --> 23:21.250
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.000 --> 23:33.340
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.000 --> 23:33.340
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.340 --> 23:39.390
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.480 --> 24:02.480
COMING UP, EPISODE 42:
FIERCE TIGER LIGHTS THE FIRE
